  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-10-27 (in session): option (b), keeping kind function. A route marker is an ADR-0031 Class B synthetic stand-in for the route: language=None, discovery_language=host language, protocol_origin from the route's transport; kind stays function, like every other Class-B stand-in. Implementation is the migration in the investigation note above (factory and materializer, consumers, ADR-0035 identity bump, bakeoff)."  # 1dbd
