  clock: 5  # e3c5
  nonce: e3c5  # e3c5
  message: "Done in PR #1908 (0777552885), on the owner ruling above: (b), keeping kind function. Every route marker is now ADR-0031 Class B: language None, discovery_language = the registration file's language, protocol_origin from its transport (http / websocket / phoenix_ipc / grpc), kind function. Behavioural evidence on merged dev: test_axiom_falsification.py::TestRouteMarkerIsAStandIn covers the express, go, rails, django and spring producers, dead-code and the routes-only file anchor; 7 of these failed on pre-change dev. test_route_marker_host_language.py is metamorphic: ranks are identical as Class B and as Class A, and reverting either entrypoints read fails it. A/B on 5 repos (916 markers): 0 stable ids moved, entrypoint ranks within 0.002, every candidate that left dead-code-maybe is a marker (spring-petclinic 30 -> 13 dead). The corpus run found two regressions, fixed in the PR: the file-anchor pass (chatwoot config/routes.rb), and dead-code's lossy Symbol rebuild. stable_id_scheme v12 -> v13, for @hg:route annotation ids only."  # e3c5
